5,0,1,talk,Mio,,"Hi everyone! This is so exciting! Let's all be super honest so we can find the werewolf quickly, okay?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Misaki,,"Honesty is good, but the werewolf will lie regardless. We should be cautious.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,A quiet approach might be safer. Let us observe each other first.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Kenji,,"I agree with Mio! If we all talk a lot, the bad guy will eventually slip up!","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,"While enthusiasm is admirable, Kenji, logic suggests that the werewolf will simply mimic our openness to blend in.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Mio,,"Oh, Benjamin is being all serious again! @Misaki, don't you think being friendly helps us trust each other?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Misaki,,Trust is a risk in this game. I prefer to watch how people react to pressure.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,Silence allows the truth to surface. I will listen for now.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Kenji,,"But if we're too quiet, it'll be scary! I want to make sure we're all okay.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Precisely why we need a system. We should look for contradictions in statements rather than relying on ""vibes.""","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Mio,,A system sounds boring! Let's just go with our gut feelings! Who feels suspicious already?,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Misaki,,It is too early for suspicions. No one has said anything incriminating yet.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,I agree with Misaki. Let us not rush to judgment.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Kenji,,I don't think anyone is suspicious yet! We all seem like nice people.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Mio, your eagerness to deflect toward ""gut feelings"" is an interesting choice. It avoids the need for evidence.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Mio,,"Hey! I'm just being me! You're making me sound like the bad guy, Benjamin!","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Misaki,,Let's just see what happens tomorrow.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
