35,1,1,talk,Mio,,Good morning! Did everyone sleep well? I hope no one is feeling nervous today!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,1,talk,Misaki,,We have to decide who to vote for. We need a lead.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I have a strong feeling about one of us.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"Wait, Jonathan! You sound like you know something! Are you the Seer?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"@Jonathan, that is a very pointed statement. Please elaborate on your ""feeling.""","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Mio,,"Maybe Jonathan is just guessing! We can't just trust one person's feeling, right? That's too risky!","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"If Jonathan is the Seer, his information is the only objective fact we have.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I can confirm that Mio is the werewolf.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Kenji,,What?! Mio? No way! She's way too cheerful to be a werewolf!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"The probability of Jonathan lying as a werewolf is there, but his calm demeanor is consistent.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Mio,,"This is totally unfair! Jonathan is just trying to frame me because I'm energetic! @Kenji, you believe me, right?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"The accusation is direct. @Jonathan, why reveal yourself so early?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,Because the village cannot afford a mistake.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"I don't know... Mio seems so nice. Are you sure, Jonathan?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Kenji, emotion is a liability here. Jonathan has provided a clear target.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Mio,,I'm just a villager! Please don't listen to him! He's the one being mysterious!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Misaki,,The logic follows Jonathan's lead. I will vote accordingly.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,The truth is plain.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"I... I guess I have to trust the Seer, even if it's sad.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"The evidence is the claim itself. Unless someone else claims Seer, Mio is the logical choice.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
